{
  "title": "CloudFormation · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "AWS 인프라 구성을 템플릿과 스택으로 선언한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>CloudFormation</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#templates-and-resources\">Templates and Resources</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#intrinsic-functions-and-dependencies\">Intrinsic Functions and Dependencies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Stacks and Change Sets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#updates-replacement-and-rollback\">Updates, Replacement and Rollback</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#deletionpolicy-and-updatereplacepolicy\">DeletionPolicy and UpdateReplacePolicy</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#drift-detection\">Drift Detection</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#nested-stacks-and-stacksets\">Nested Stacks and StackSets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#custom-resources-hooks-and-iam\">Custom Resources, Hooks and IAM</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>운영·비용</span><span>08 / 62</span></div><h1>CloudFormation</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>CloudFormation은 Template으로 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 리소스의 원하는 구성을 선언하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Stack</a>으로 생성·변경·삭제를 관리한다. Infrastructure as Code를 통해 반복 배포·Version 관리·검토 가능한 변경을 만든다.</p><p>Template은 Infrastructure의 정의다. Database 데이터와 파일 내용의 Backup은 별도이며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Stack</a> 재생성만으로 원래 사용자 데이터가 돌아오지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"선언·검토·배포\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>선언·검토·배포</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Deployment</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Versioned Template</strong><small>Resources·Parameters</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Change Set</a></strong><small>Replacement·삭제 영향 검토</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Stack</a> Update</strong><small>원하는 Infrastructure 상태</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Operational protection</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Actual resources</strong><small>수동 변경 가능</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#drift-detection\">Drift Detection</a></strong><small>지원 설정 차이 탐지</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Backup + Retain policies</strong><small>데이터 보호는 별도 설계</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Template만으로 애플리케이션 데이터의 과거 상태가 복구되지는 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"templates-and-resources\"><h2>Templates and Resources<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#templates-and-resources\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>JSON·YAML Template의 Resources에 리소스 유형·속성을 선언한다. Parameters, Mappings, Conditions, Outputs로 배포 입력과 결과를 구성한다. Secret 값을 평문 Template·Output에 넣지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"intrinsic-functions-and-dependencies\"><h2>Intrinsic Functions and Dependencies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#intrinsic-functions-and-dependencies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Ref·GetAtt·Sub 등으로 값을 참조·조합한다. 참조 관계는 생성 순서의 의존성을 만들며 필요한 경우 DependsOn을 사용한다. 순환 의존성은 Template 설계를 분리해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"stacks-and-change-sets\"><h2>Stacks and Change Sets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Stack</a>은 Template에서 관리하는 리소스 집합이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Change Set</a>으로 Update 전 추가·변경·삭제·Replacement 영향을 검토한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Change Set</a>이 애플리케이션 데이터 손실 가능성을 자동 제거하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"updates-replacement-and-rollback\"><h2>Updates, Replacement and Rollback<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#updates-replacement-and-rollback\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>속성 변경에 따라 In-place Update 또는 새 리소스 Replacement가 발생한다. 실패 시 Rollback 정책과 복구 상태를 확인한다. 이름·Endpoint·Storage가 바뀌는 변경은 앱 전환을 함께 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"deletionpolicy-and-updatereplacepolicy\"><h2>DeletionPolicy and UpdateReplacePolicy<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#deletionpolicy-and-updatereplacepolicy\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>삭제·교체 때 Retain·Snapshot 등 지원 처리를 지정한다. 두 속성은 적용 상황이 다르다. Retain된 리소스는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Stack</a> 삭제 뒤에도 비용과 관리 책임이 남는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"drift-detection\"><h2>Drift Detection<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#drift-detection\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 리소스의 실제 설정과 Template 기대값 차이를 탐지한다. 모든 속성·리소스의 모든 변경을 탐지하는 것은 아니다. 지속 Compliance 평가가 목적이면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>와 함께 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"nested-stacks-and-stacksets\"><h2>Nested Stacks and StackSets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#nested-stacks-and-stacksets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#nested-stacks-and-stacksets\">Nested Stack</a>은 Template을 구성 요소로 나누고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#nested-stacks-and-stacksets\">StackSets</a>는 여러 계정·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 배포한다. 권한 모델·실패 허용·배포 순서를 설정한다. 여러 계정 배포는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">Organizations</a> 경계를 함께 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"custom-resources-hooks-and-iam\"><h2>Custom Resources, Hooks and IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#custom-resources-hooks-and-iam\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Custom Resource로 지원하지 않는 작업을 연결하고 Hook으로 지원 검증을 수행할 수 있다. Service Role에는 필요한 배포 권한만 준다. Custom Resource의 Retry·Delete·Rollback 처리를 Idempotent하게 작성한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>를 Template으로 Version 관리하고 운영 Update는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#stacks-and-change-sets\">Change Set</a>에서 Replacement를 확인한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>에는 Backup·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/#deletionpolicy-and-updatereplacepolicy\">DeletionPolicy</a>를 별도로 설정한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>템플릿은 애플리케이션 데이터 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a>이 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSCloudFormation/latest/UserGuide/Welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSCloudFormation/latest/UserGuide/Welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q079/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q079\" data-question=\"Q079\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q079</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q079/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to deploy a large application into multiple accounts from repeatable infrastructure templates. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q079\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q079\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q079\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q079\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">CloudFormation</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 인프라를 선언적 템플릿·스택으로 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">CloudFormation</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q078\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q078/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q093\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q005\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q022\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">이전 용어 <b>Budgets / Cost Explorer</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">다음 용어 <b>CloudFront</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
